pinctrl: qcom: sm6115: Claim the eGPIO pins 98 to 112.

GPIOs 98-112 are eGPIOs, like on QCM2290: until the EGPIO_ENABLE bit
is set in the control register, the pad belongs to another subsystem
and the TLMM output does not reach it. The TB-J606L powers both camera
sensors from GPIOs 108 and 112, which stayed low without this.

